<title>GREECE: TABLE - Greek/Bund gap shrinks to 393bps, 291 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Greek/Bund gap shrinks to 393bps, 291 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds shrank to 393 basis points on Monday from Friday's 400.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also narrowed to 291 basis points from 303 on Friday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.55%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.62%	393	400 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.54%	401	409 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.64%	291	303 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.32%	323	328 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.29%	326	336 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.15%	240	250 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.29%	326	343 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0900 GMT. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
